{
  "title": "AWS Backup · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "지원 리소스의 백업 정책·일정·보존을 중앙 관리한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backup</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-plans-and-rules\">Backup Plans and Rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#resource-assignments\">Resource Assignments</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Backup Vaults and Recovery Points</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#lifecycle-and-cold-storage\">Lifecycle and Cold Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#cross-region-and-cross-account-copy\">Cross-Region and Cross-Account Copy</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#vault-lock\">Vault Lock</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#logically-air-gapped-vault\">Logically Air-Gapped Vault</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#continuous-backup-and-pitr\">Continuous Backup and PITR</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#restore-testing-and-audit-manager\">Restore Testing and Audit Manager</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>05 / 62</span></div><h1>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backup</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Backup은 지원 서비스의 Backup 생성·보존·Copy·Restore를 중앙 정책으로 관리한다. 각 서비스의 개별 Backup 기능 위에 조직 수준 정책·Vault·감사를 구성할 수 있다.</p><p>Backup 성공과 복구 목표 달성은 별개다. Restore된 데이터가 읽히는지, Key·Role·Network·애플리케이션 연결까지 복구되는지를 테스트해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Backup 정책과 실제 복구\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Backup 정책과 실제 복구</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Protection</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-plans-and-rules\">Backup Plan</a></strong><small>Schedule·Retention·Tag</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Backup Vault</a></strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Recovery Point</a>·Key·Lock</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Copy</strong><small>지원 Cross-account·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Recovery</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Recovery Point</a></strong><small>복구 시점 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Restore</strong><small>리소스·권한·Network 재구성</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Application test</strong><small>데이터·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a> 검증</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Backup 생성 성공만으로 애플리케이션의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>가 검증되지는 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-plans-and-rules\"><h2>Backup Plans and Rules<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-plans-and-rules\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Plan의 Rule에서 Schedule, Backup Window, Lifecycle, Copy 등을 정의한다. 지원 리소스의 Backup 실행 시점을 정책으로 관리한다. Snapshot 기반과 Continuous Backup 지원은 리소스별로 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"resource-assignments\"><h2>Resource Assignments<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#resource-assignments\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>ARN <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Resource Name)</span> 또는 Tag 등으로 보호할 리소스를 선택한다. 새 리소스에 Tag가 빠지면 의도한 정책에 포함되지 않을 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">IAM Role</a>과 지원 서비스 Opt-in 설정도 함께 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\"><h2>Backup Vaults and Recovery Points<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Vault는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Recovery Point</a>를 관리하는 경계이고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Recovery Point</a>는 Restore에 사용하는 Backup 단위다. Vault Policy와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> Key로 접근·암호화를 제어한다. Backup Metadata와 원래 리소스의 세부 복원 조건은 서비스별로 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"lifecycle-and-cold-storage\"><h2>Lifecycle and Cold Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#lifecycle-and-cold-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Backup을 Cold Storage로 옮기고 Retention 종료 뒤 삭제한다. 리소스별 Cold 지원과 최소 보관 조건을 확인한다. 빠른 Restore가 필요한 최근 Backup을 비용만 보고 전부 Cold로 이동하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cross-region-and-cross-account-copy\"><h2>Cross-Region and Cross-Account Copy<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#cross-region-and-cross-account-copy\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·계정 분리로 장애·권한 탈취 위험을 줄인다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations</a>·Key·Vault Policy 등 Cross-account 조건이 필요하다. 모든 Resource 유형이 동일한 Copy·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a> 범위를 지원하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"vault-lock\"><h2>Vault Lock<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#vault-lock\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Governance Mode와 Compliance Mode로 Backup 삭제·Retention 변경을 제한한다. Compliance의 Grace Period 뒤에는 강한 변경 제한이 적용된다. 보존 정책을 잘못 고정하면 필요한 삭제도 제한되므로 적용 전 기간을 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"logically-air-gapped-vault\"><h2>Logically Air-Gapped Vault<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#logically-air-gapped-vault\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Backup을 강화된 격리 모델로 보관하고 복구 공유·접근 절차를 구성한다. 일반 Vault와 Key·공유·복원 지원 조건이 다르다. 네트워크를 끊어 놓은 고객 장비와 동일한 의미는 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"continuous-backup-and-pitr\"><h2>Continuous Backup and PITR <span class=\"full-name\">(Point-in-Time Recovery)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#continuous-backup-and-pitr\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 리소스는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">Point-in-time Restore</a>를 제공한다. Snapshot Schedule과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a>의 복구 가능 시점·보존 기간은 다르다. Copy된 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#backup-vaults-and-recovery-points\">Recovery Point</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a> 기능이 그대로 유지되는지도 서비스별로 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"restore-testing-and-audit-manager\"><h2>Restore Testing and Audit Manager<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#restore-testing-and-audit-manager\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Restore Testing은 지원 리소스의 복구를 자동 검증하도록 구성한다. Audit Manager는 Backup 정책·보호·Compliance 증거를 평가한다. 서비스 수준 Restore 성공 뒤 앱 기능 검증도 필요하다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>여러 계정의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> Backup을 Tag 기반 Plan으로 보호하고 별도 계정·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 Copy한다. 정기 Restore Testing과 앱 점검으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>를 확인한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>백업이 생성되었다는 사실만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>가 충족되지는 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/aws-backup/latest/devguide/whatisbackup.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">aws-backup/latest/devguide/whatisbackup.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q052\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q078\" data-question=\"Q078\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q078</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q078/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A workload allows at most 15 minutes of data loss and must be restored within 2 hours. Which values correspond to those requirements?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RPO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">RPO of 15 minutes and RTO of 2 hours</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Both are RTO values</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q078\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">RTO of 15 minutes and RPO of 2 hours</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-point-objective\">RPO</a>는 데이터 손실 허용 시점, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>는 서비스 복구까지 허용 시간이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q085\" data-question=\"Q085\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q085</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q085/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO S3 features help protect against accidental deletion and manage long-term retention?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow all traffic in a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Lifecycle or retention policies</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q085\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B, D</strong> · 이전 버전을 유지하고 접근 패턴·보존 기간에 맞춰 수명 주기를 설정한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q093\" data-question=\"Q093\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q093</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q093/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO targets must be established for a database recovery strategy that withstands a Region outage?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery time objective (RTO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the network ACL rule number</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Recovery point objective (RPO)</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The color of the AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q093\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">The length of an Elastic IP address name</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, C</strong> · 허용 데이터 손실과 복구 시간을 목표로 정해야 복제·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 전략을 선택할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q001\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q001\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">이전 용어 <b>Aurora</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">다음 용어 <b>AZ</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
